Chapter: DbBootMain
  cites Data chapter DbBoot
  cites Data chapter Catalog

 DATA-W3. This entry point was the last section of `DbBoot`, and while it sat
 there `DbBoot` could be cited by nobody: a program has exactly one `opening`
 (CDX3001), so `Dashboard` and `DbAdmin`, which both cite `DbBoot`, could not
 be pulled into any unit and were compiled by nothing. The boot state stays in
 `DbBoot`; only the entry point moved.

Section: Entry Point

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let config = default-db-config
    in let state = db-boot-init config
    in let state2 = bootstrap-system-tables state
    in act
      print-line-uni (db-boot-banner config)
      print-line-uni (db-health state2)
      print-line-uni ("system tables: " & catalog-stats (state2.dbs-server.db-catalog))
    end
  end

